Output docs/media/inbox.gif
Set Shell zsh
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1640
Set Height 860
Set Padding 16
Set TypingSpeed 60ms
Hide
Type "cd ~/Development/claude-mods-demo && env -u CLAUDECODE -u CLAUDE_CODE_CHILD_SESSION -u CLAUDE_CODE_SESSION_ID -u CLAUDE_CODE_BRIDGE_SESSION_ID -u CLAUDE_CODE_MESSAGING_SOCKET -u CLAUDE_CODE_MESSAGING_TOKEN -u CLAUDE_CODE_ENTRYPOINT -u CLAUDE_PID -u CLAUDE_CODE_SESSION_ATTENDED claude" Enter
Sleep 6s
Down Enter
Sleep 8s
Show
Sleep 1s
Type "/inbox"
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Sleep 3.5s
Type "j"
Sleep 2.5s
Type "s"
Sleep 1.5s
Type "j"
Sleep 2.5s
Type "s"
Sleep 1s
Type "k"
Sleep 1.5s
Type "r"
Sleep 1.5s
Type "New column. Ship the backfill behind a flag."
Sleep 3s
Hide
Ctrl+C
Ctrl+C
